<title>CHINA: China Jan-Feb cotton imports up 72.7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Feb cotton imports up 72.7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 160,000 tonnes of cotton in the first two months, up 72.7 percent from the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>China's cotton imports reached 70,000 tonnes in February alone, the figures showed.</p>
<p>Cotton exports in January and February were zero, compared with 470 tonnes in the first two months of last year, the figures showed.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
